[F]'Till all my [G]people are [C]one.

{section: Verse 1}
[Am]Spread the [Em]peace, my [Am]brothers; spread it everywhere[F]; [G]
H[C]elp the w[Em]orld know ri[Am]ght from wrong; [D7]help the world to care.[G]

